%% Six packages; seven principal dependency signatures. Labeled package rectangles and flowchart arrow glyphs stand in for native UML folders/open dependencies.
%% Every dashed open arrow is package dependence, not REST/WS traffic. No package-to-package realization is implied.
%% Presentation relies on versioned public API contracts; this does not require shared compiled client/backend code.
%% Domain has no dependency on UI, frameworks, providers, storage or contracts. Application owns its six port interfaces.
%% The three product surfaces and Android React Native / TypeScript and FastAPI / Python facts are confirmed.
%% Teacher/Admin frameworks remain TBD. B8 contexts, realtime entry and adapter implementations remain proposed.
%% Contract boundary shapes are distinct from domain entities; provider/model responses must be mapped and validated.
%% Runtime protocols, separate worker process and provider/candidate choices remain in System Architecture v2.

flowchart LR
    PRESENTATION["<b>«package» Presentation</b><br/><br/>Child Android · React Native / TypeScript<br/>Teacher Desktop · UI framework TBD<br/>Super Admin · UI framework TBD"]

    INBOUND["<b>«package» Inbound Adapters</b><br/><br/>HTTP entry points · FastAPI / Python<br/>Realtime entry points · proposed"]

    APPLICATION["<b>«package» Application</b><br/><br/>Use cases · authorization / consent<br/>Scope / version checks<br/>Owned ports: Repository / Artifact / Job<br/>Identity / Model / Realtime"]

    DOMAIN["<b>«package» Domain</b><br/><br/>B8 contexts · proposed<br/>Identity / Consent<br/>Classroom<br/>Session / Groups<br/>Drawing / Collaboration<br/>AI Assistance<br/>Knowledge / Media<br/>Activities<br/>Portfolio / Assessment<br/>Governance / Audit"]

    CONTRACTS["<b>«package» Versioned Contracts</b><br/><br/>Request / response DTOs<br/>Commands and queries<br/>Events and typed results<br/>Versioned boundary schemas"]

    INFRASTRUCTURE["<b>«package» Infrastructure Adapters</b><br/><br/>Repository / Artifact / Job adapters<br/>Identity / Model / Realtime adapters<br/>Implements Application-owned ports<br/>Maps external results to contracts<br/>Implementations proposed"]

    PRESENTATION -.->|uses public API contracts| CONTRACTS
    INBOUND -.->|dispatches use cases| APPLICATION
    INBOUND -.->|maps boundary DTOs| CONTRACTS
    APPLICATION -.->|uses domain rules| DOMAIN
    APPLICATION -.->|uses versioned contracts| CONTRACTS
    INFRASTRUCTURE -.->|depends on port interfaces| APPLICATION
    INFRASTRUCTURE -.->|maps typed results| CONTRACTS

    style PRESENTATION fill:#ffffff,stroke:#52616b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#263238;
    style INBOUND fill:#ffffff,stroke:#52616b,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#263238;
